# Copy to .env.local and fill in from your Supabase project:
#   Dashboard → Project Settings → API
#
# Both are safe to expose — Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed value into the
# client bundle, so treat them as public. Row Level Security is what actually
# protects the data; see supabase/migrations/20260801_enable_rls.sql.
#
# Leave these unset and the app still runs: everything is local-first and only
# cloud sync is unavailable. Set them to something malformed and the Supabase
# client throws on construction, which takes the app down with it.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_your_key_here
